     {
      "pClass": "productdescription",
      "pText": "Play Pulse comes in a multi colour finish, which keeps it bright on a plain lawn or a grey podium. Its towers are joined by linked decks, with climbing nets to get up and tube slides to come down. The footprint is close to square at 39'6\" x 38'5\", so it sits well in the middle of a park or society play area with paths on all sides. Children climb, slide and hang across the decks. The age group is 3+ and key users are 3 to 12, with a listed capacity of 15. The safe play area is 45'6\" x 43'5\". If you want particular colours, we can discuss our roto-moulded shade options. We warrant the galvanised pipe, roto-moulded parts, composite laminates and play rope for 3 years. Ask us for a quote and a drawing for your site."
     }
    ]
